  if (has("save", "säästä", "saving", "säästö", "goal", "tavoite"))
    return { text: `Right now you net about ${fmt(D.netAvg)}/mo after investing ${fmt(D.investAvg)}/mo — that investing habit is great. 🌱\n\nThe fastest extra lever is the Flex Zone: September was ${fmt(D.flex.latest)} vs your ${fmt(D.flex.avg)} average. Getting back to average frees ${fmt(D.flex.latest - D.flex.avg)}/mo — that's ${fmt((D.flex.latest - D.flex.avg) * 12)} a year.` };
  if (has("invest", "sijoit", "fund", "rahasto", "stock", "osake"))
    return { text: `You invest ${fmt(D.investAvg)}/mo on average (latest deposit ${fmt(235.72, 2)} on 18 Sep). At 26 that's a strong start — time in the market is your superpower. 📈\n\nKeep it automatic on payday so it happens before Flex spending does. I can't tell you what to buy, but I can show what a bigger monthly amount would grow into.` };
  if (has("health", "terveys", "apteek", "pharmacy", "doctor", "lääkär", "medicine", "lääke"))
    return { text: `Health is your biggest Life Happens cost: ${fmt(D.life.breakdown.Health)}/mo on average. Top merchants: ${D.healthTop.map((h) => `${h.n} ${fmt(h.v)}`).join(", ")} over 24 months.\n\nTip: check whether Kela reimbursement or your employer's occupational health care (työterveys) covers any of these — and keep a ${fmt(D.life.avg)}/mo buffer pot so the next August-style spike (${fmt(D.life.aug)}) doesn't sting.` };
  if (has("balance", "saldo", "how much", "paljonko", "money", "rahaa", "afford"))
